Thu Nov  5 19:37:22 UTC 2026 - Matej Cepl <mcepl@cepl.eu>

- Update to 1.1.0:
  - Features:
    - --dry-run previews write requests without sending them on
      commands that only change Gitea.
    - --template formats JSON output with Go templates and gh
      functions.
    - gt schema lists JSON fields of every command.
    - GITEA_CLI_ERROR_FORMAT=json reports failures as JSON on
      stderr.
    - gt gpg-key manages GPG keys with token verification.
    - gt issue and gt pr lock, unlock, pin, unpin and delete
      support batch operations.
    - gt pr edit and gt issue edit support bi-directional
      dependency changes.
    - --select interactive selector on issue, pr, release, and
      repo lists.
    - gt notification list --all-accounts lists notifications
      across all logged-in accounts.
    - gt repo license and gt repo gitignore manage repository
      templates.
    - gt project workflow manages project board workflows
      (needs Gitea 29).
    - gt admin adds user, org, cron, and email administration
      commands.
  - Internal:
    - Update gitea.dev/sdk to v1.5.1.

